window.products.push({"id":306014,"name":"Nanko Comforter Set Queen Size, 3pc Boho Red Blue Colorful Retro Striped Pattern Print 88 x 90 inch Reversible Comforter Microfiber Duvet Sets Bedding","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K1w3g+bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Microfiber The 3 piece comforter set includes 1 duvet insert or stand-along comforter (88 x 90 inches) and 2 matching pillow shams (20 x 26 inches) Boho Colorful Retro Design - luxury and farmhouse, great for your bedding décor. You may also use this comforter set for guest room or as a gift for family members or friends to present your good taste. It is cute bedding set for men or women. Soft & Fluffy – All season comforter with down alternative filling, lightweight and fluffy. Fabrics is made of 100% luxury brushed microfiber, giving you exceptionally soft and silky feeling. Our breathable comforter will ensure you a cozy sleep throughout the night, cool in the summer, comfortable in the spring and fall, and even warm in the winter in southern area. Durable – Our unique solid stitching for the comforter largely improve its durability, well preventing bunching. Easy Care - Machine wash in a gentle cycle with cold water. Plus, you may secure the comforter with pre-sewn tabs to a duvet cover. With the help of duvet cover, you will be able to protect it easily for a longer period of time. You may also find matching covers in our shop. PLEASE NOTE that upon receipt of your new bedding product, it is highly recommended to dry it in low heat or tap it gently while baking it in the sun for a few hours to make it fluffy again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K1w3g+bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nanko","source_asin":"B085TDW638","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306014","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085TDW638","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085TDW638","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
