window.products.push({"id":306023,"name":"Elvis Presley - The King of Rock n Roll Memorabilia Prints/Photos | Elvis Presley Merchandise | Elvis Presley Posters | Elvis Presley Gifts | Elvis Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zmNox-U6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jazz up your living and office space with these breathtaking memorabilia prints of the king of Rock n Roll, Elvis Presley. With this stunning photo hanged somewhere in your home or office, you can expect your place to look spruced up.  Are you tired of those empty wall space in your office or living space and looking for a smart way to make it more interesting? Well, getting this incredible Elvis Presley Wall décor photo will bring your living or office space alive, allowing you to invite guests into your home with confidence.  Featuring four beautiful photos of the King of Rock n Roll, Elvis Presley, this wall prints will add that dramatic touch that will make your room or office space pop. Yes, you may not have met the Rock n Roll legend himself, but you can show people how much he and his music meant to you, by hanging his wall décor prints in your home.  Amazingly, this wall prints are made from quality materials including top-notch glossy paper and inks. This means it will not just transform your living or office space but will last you even longer than you imagine.  Finding the perfect gift for a friend or loved one celebrating their special day can be daunting sometimes, but guess what, nobody will refuse a wall décor print of the king of Rock N Roll, Elvis Presley. Get them this wall decal prints today and see how excited they will be.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zmNox-U6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PrintPros","source_asin":"B01FMX48DO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FMX48DO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FMX48DO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
