window.products.push({"id":306057,"name":"Enameled Cast Iron Dutch Oven 7.5 Quart with Lid Red and Trivet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610DV5w+W+L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The T&H Danc cookware are indispensable in the kitchens of home cooks and professional chefs alike. Long recognized for its strength and durability, cast iron is the prime material for slow-cooking, braising and roasting thanks to its ability to maintain even and consistent heat. Our products are warranted to you by T&H Danc to be free from defects in material and workmanship at the time of purchase. Small cosmetic blemishes inherent to sand casting and hand finishing which do not affect the performance are not covered. Product Features *Distributes heat evenly over the entire vessel, thickened bottom making it ideal for all forms of cooking, whether slow-cooking, roasting, searing, stir-frying or baking on gas, electric, ceramic and induction cooktops as well as in the oven.  *Smooth exterior enamel, the glass-like finish promotes caramelization, resists staining and prevents sticking to make it easy to clean up.  *Black interior enamel is specially formulated for high-temperature cooking. Requires no seasoning, and is suitable for both stovetop and oven use. Extra depth contains splatters, and creates greater capacity while taking up less space on the stovetop.  *Concave-shaped 4.95lbs lid with 44 water drops design locks in flavor by promoting continuous circulation of heat and moisture.  *Wide loop and oversized double handles allow for a sturdy grip and mobility while cooking and moving; 0.8 in heightened and strengthened knob make it easy to place; embedded screw avoid connecting between metal and food. Package Included *1 x T&H Danc dutch oven *1 x T&H Danc lid *1 x Trivet mat  *1 x Manual Tips *Allow to cool before washing.  *Dry cookware thoroughly before storing.  *Enamel can chip or crack if dropped or banged on hard surface.  *Avoid using steel wool, steel scouring pads, harsh detergents or abrasive cleansers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610DV5w+W+L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T&H Danc","source_asin":"B07KPTRB6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPTRB6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPTRB6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
