window.products.push({"id":306218,"name":"PERSONALIZED Handmade Lip Balm Party Favors in Strawberry Flavor (40)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417kYNjHy+L.jpg","description":"HOW TO PERSONALIZE: After your order comes through I will send you an email through Amazon titled 'Order Information' and you can reply to me with your wording. Handmade Flavored, Light Pink Tinted Lip Balms in our Pink and White Stripe label design with your wording! Perfect for a Birthday Party, Bachelorette Party, Bridal Shower, Baby Shower or Spa Party. Lip Balms are Treenut and Peanut Free and naturally have an SPF 6 I have different quantities set up for this label design. If you don't see the quantity you need simply send me a note with the number of lip balms you need with the wording you would like and I can set up a custom listing for you. LIP BALM INGREDIENTS: Our lip balm is made fresh the same are made day as your order is placed so that they are perfectly fresh for your event. They are made with Castor Seed Oil, Canola Oil, Cocoa Butter, Olive Oil, Beeswax, Soybean Oil, Carnauba Wax and Candelilla Wax. The lip balm will be light pink, it will apply clear on the lips like regular chapstick. TUBES: Tubes are clear, full size .15oz and round. LABELS: Our labels are white and made from weatherproof matte inkjet material. It is ideal for applications that may come into contact with moisture. It utilizes a waterfast inkjet coating that is designed to repel water and a strong, permanent adhesive. The label may scratch if it comes in contact with a sharp object but the wording is not expected to smear. TESTIMONIAL: \"I have to post this...the seller is a wonderful lady. And, especially at this time of the year she is so kind and helpful. It is a pleasure to know someone of her caliber. She has a special touch and her products prove it. They are the best products for your skin without using harsh and harmful chemicals. I recommend her as a caring and decent human being and her products as safe and beneficial for your body.\" -Susan","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417kYNjHy+L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Majestic Lips","source_asin":"B079H5KJJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079H5KJJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079H5KJJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
