window.products.push({"id":306573,"name":"Kathy Ireland Home 1200 Thread Count Cotton Rich 6 Piece Sheet Set with Bonus Pillowcases - 6 Colors (King, Linen)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811VZJI-MhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As her image appeared on magazines and in ads around the world in the 1980s and ’90s, supermodel Kathy Ireland quickly learned how taxing a busy schedule can be. As she searched for stylish yet no-fuss clothing and housewares, she realized that other busy parents and businesspeople probably needed them, too. She founded her own company in 1993, which creates home goods, wedding accessories, apparel, and fine jewelry—all influenced by her exacting personal taste. The company has grown into an empire that’s made Ireland “a bigger licensor than the formidable Martha Stewart,” according to Forbes, and it’s regarded as one of top 30 most influential brands in the world by License! Global magazine. Slip into comfort and peaceful slumber with this luxurious 1200 Thread Count sheet set by Kathy Ireland Home. Composed of 55 percent cotton and 45 percent polyester, this high quality sheet set is wrinkle resistant without chemical processing. These single ply sheets have a lustrous sateen finish and fully elasticized fitted sheet with deep pockets. Available in a wide range of solid color options, this set is conveniently machine washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811VZJI-MhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kathy ireland","source_asin":"B01MUC3F3W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MUC3F3W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MUC3F3W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
