window.products.push({"id":306622,"name":"Becky Cameron Box ienjoy Home 8 Piece Bed in a Bag, Twin, Aqua (BC-Multi-Twin-Aqua)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wl3PEMwvL._AC_SL1305_.jpg","description":"The Becky Cameron 8 piece bed in a bag by ienjoy Home is designed with your comfort in mind. Made of the finest imported double-brushed microfiber yarns, creating a new standard in softness and breathability, this 8 piece bedding set will make it incredibly hard to get out of bed in the morning. Our premium yarns are two times more durable than cotton, completely wrinkle free, and perfect for all seasons.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Wl3PEMwvL._AC_SL1305_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Becky Cameron","source_asin":"B0BZ6X37SR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ6X37SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ6X37SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":306623,"name":"MEIDI Humidifier - Aromatherapy Diffuser, LED Desk Moon Lamp with Cool Mist Humidifier Function, Adjustable Brightness and Mist Mode (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51upluptmEL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"★ Attractive Night Lamp Design & Rechargeable - Perhaps you’re very familiar with 3D printing technology, but it would be an interesting thing when the technology applies to this night lamp. Moreover, this LED desk lamp built-in 3.7V Lithium battery so that it’s rechargeable and can run for 8 hours. ★ Two in One Application - Besides the LED light, this product can also be used as a personal Humidifier, Moisturizer, Ionizer & Aroma Diffuser for soothing aromatherapy. It is made of PVC, PP and silicone materials with distinctive moon shape design. ★ Three Colors Choices & Intelligent Touch-Sensor - This table lamp designs with 3 colors choices which are white, orange and yellow and lighting modes. All of the colors can be changed by touch the metal head. At the same time, when you long press the metal head, the brightness of the lights will be brighter, releasing and then long press again, the brightness will be dim. Besides, memory function enables the last time brightness of corresponding color to be remembered when the light is turned on. ★ Two Mist Modes Setting and Control - The Mist button is another metal head, but remember to connect the USB cord before using. The first time press is the continuous spray mode which can be used for 10 hrs, and the second time press is the intermittent spray mode that can be used for 20 hrs. The humidifier will auto shut off in order to guarantee your safety in 10 hours, so you don’t need to worry about the safety issue during the time while you sleep. ★ Cool Mist & Whisper Quite - Adopted with advanced ultrasonic technology, Ionize essential water into the air to keep the air moist, Moisturizing the skin and reducing radiation. Super quiet atmosphere can provide you a calm and comfortable sleeping night with warm light.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51upluptmEL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEIDI","source_asin":"B0813B2RWZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0813B2RWZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0813B2RWZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
