window.products.push({"id":306632,"name":"BONZER 100% Blackout Curtains for Bedroom - Premium Thick Velvet Curtains 63 Inches Long Thermal Insulated Energy Saving, Sun Light Blocking Grommet W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710e09OQ2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each set includes 2 blackout curtain panels with each panel measuring 52-inch width by 63-inch length. The curtains are finished with rust proof grommets/eyelets with 8 grommets with 1.6 inch diameter to easily accommodate the pole 100% BLACKOUT MATERIAL: BONZER blackout curtains is crafted from soft and waterproof velvet fabric, added with 100% blackout layer on the back. Thick triple-weaved fabric can block out sunlight and turn day to night. These curtains are manufactured in a STANDARD 100 certified by the OEKO TEX factory. THERMAL INSULATED AND ENERGY EFFCIENT CURTAINS: Our energy efficient curtains can naturally balance your room temperature by insulating against heat during summer and cold during winter at the same time acting as a barrier preventing energy from escaping the room. They also protect your furniture from sun and UV ray ravages. NOISE REDUCING AND PRIVACY PROTECTING: These completely opaque room darkening curtains are perfect to prevent unwanted views and viewers ensuring your private moments stay private. Our noise reducing panels are thick enough to absorb and reduce some noise. Use them as window treatment or room dividers, they are perfect for every room. EASY CARE: These wrinkle free blackout curtains are machine washable and are color fade resistant. Wash with cold or warm water, DO NOT BLEACH. Tumble dry low and cool iron as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710e09OQ2rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BONZER","source_asin":"B08JJ267CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JJ267CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JJ267CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":306633,"name":"1.5L/3L/5L/10L Vintage Wood Timber Wine Barrel Dispenser for Beer Brandy Tequila Whiskey Rum Port (5L)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L+IeXz7kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"NOTE: -The inside of the barrel is made of food-grade aluminum alloy, not plastic. -The barrel cannot be used for brewing wine. It's just a container for wine and drinks. Please confirm before purchasing. Usage: Take down the faucet, put the wine barrel on the table, the mouth side facing up, slowly pour drinks from the faucet connector, then tighten the faucet. Specification: Condition: 100% Brand New Color: Wine red Capacity: 1.5 / 3L / 5 L / 10 L (Optional) (1.5L) Size: 20 x 20 x 28.5cm / 7.87 x 7.87 x 11.22 inch (appr.) (3L) Size:  22.5 x 23.5 x 30.5cm / 8.86 x 9.25 x 12 inch (appr.) (5L) Size:  25 x 27 x 35.5cm / 9.84 x 10.63 x 13.98 inch (appr.) (10L) Size:  26 x 28 x 38cm / 10.24 x 11.02 x 14.96 inch (appr.) Package Included: 1 x barrel 1 x  stand 1 x  cork 1 x  tap (wooden) 1 x Manual Note: The outside of the barrel is made of wood, the wood is only for decoration, and there is food grade Foil bag as inner gallbladder. The wood is not waterproof. Wooden barrel maintenance: 1. The wood used in the barrel is dried wood, so it is forbidden to soak in water. The towel should not be too wet when wiping. 2. The thickness of the wooden barrel of the wine barrel is about 1.28cm, which prevents the nails or protruding rafts from piercing the inner liner. 3, in the summer high temperature, the added wine or liquid should not be too full, to prevent the overflow of alcohol or other liquids caused by heat rise. 4. If there is leakage at the faucet interface, first release the wine or other liquid, check the plastic interface, if there is no cracking, re-twist the faucet and tighten it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61L+IeXz7kL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eapmic","source_asin":"B0842GV8H5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0842GV8H5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0842GV8H5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":306634,"name":"Geohee Electric Can Opener, Restaurant can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener Chef's Best Choice,Best Kitchen Gadget for Arthriti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NLo+ReVkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Operating the Can Opener Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can Trouble Shooting 1. If batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Cans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. 3. If the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of the can opener. Note: 1.Use 2 new batteries ( High quality AA batteries), er less quality new batteries are inadequate and may not preform as necessary. 2. After completely revolving around the can and cutting the edge, the can will still appear to be sealed. After prying up the lid will it be evident that the can and its resealable lid are detached. 3. Do not lift or forcefully remove the can opener from the can while it is operational. Forceful removal can cause damage to the knife-edge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NLo+ReVkL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Geohee","source_asin":"B09J28B74H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J28B74H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J28B74H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
