window.products.push({"id":306741,"name":"Direction Desk Height Adjustable Standup Desk Frame Only w/Electric Dual Motor, Durable White Standing Desk Frame for Sit Stand Rising Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":416.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yk-9ct5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DIRECTION DESK WARRANTY- You can rest easy knowing that your desk is guaranteed to work perfectly for 5+ years or you get a new desk. NO WOBBLE- Rest assured knowing your desk won't wobble like the competitions. Sturdy and stable from the lowest height to the highest. INDUSTRY LEADING ADJUSTABILITY-Do you need ADA compliance? Are you above 6'4\" tall? Whether you need it low or you need it high this desk is for you. NO NOISE- Be proud to show off your desk. The dual motors silently lift your desk creating a smooth, delightful experience. STYLISH PRESETS- The ergonomic LED control box allows for 3 saved presets. Memorize your ideal heights and hit the number once to adjust.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yk-9ct5tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Direction Desk","source_asin":"B07Y8XXZ4K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y8XXZ4K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y8XXZ4K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":306742,"name":"lomenmon Sandwish Memory Foam Pillows, Side Sleeper Pillow for Relieving Neck and Shoulder Sleep Pain Relief, Height Adjustable, Ergonomic Cervical Or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714vvLh7I3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sandwiched for Neck and Shoulder Pain: Queen Size memory foam pillow height: 4.7 / 3.9 in high. Middle layer can be removed to decrease the thickness to 3.5 / 2.7in height for lower support. Sleep in comfort with Lommenmon whether on your back, side, or stomach( To make it easier for buyers to remove the insert for easy cleaning, as well as not to damage the zip, LOMENMON's pillowcases are a little looser than the usual size). Stay Shape Forever & Warm Tips: Gently cradled Your sensitive neck with a wave structure, neck pillow is constructured of distinctive rebound space dynamic foam, which won't be hard or bunch in winter, providing consistent firmness and comfort throughout the year.PS: Please put the cushion in a cool and ventilated place for 1-2 days after opening the package before using it to bring it back to its maximum recovery shape. Ergonomic Design: If need a supportive, firm but comfortable cervical pillow, this memory foam pillow can meet your needs, better preserving the normal physiological curvature of the neck, supporting all the side, supine, prone pressure point. just close in around all areas of your neck magically. Use Advice:High pillow suitable for large weight 200kg or more people, the initial if you feel the pillow is too hard, please draw off the middle layer. Low pillow is suitable for teenagers or lighter weight, if you feel the pillow is too soft, please put it to the ventilation for 1-2 days, Side sleeper pillow will regain its hardness. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. Washable Pillowcover: pillow cover is zippered for easy access and helps keep the pillow together since it is actually in three separate pieces. Washable and machine washable, extending the life of the ergonomic foam pillow while the exterior cover keeps the foam clean and breathable. A Luxury Gift of Love: As the excellent gift for family and friends, memory pillow is suitable for seniors, office workers, students and people of all ages, it is the great expression of caring for those you care about. Certified Pillows: Lomenmon bed pillows are made of high quality certified materials that meet STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX . Sleep well with our cervical pillow and travel pillow. Warm Tips Again: If you receive the side sleeper pillow and find that the pillowcase is too big and the sponge can't bounce back for a short time, please contact us promptly, it is not a product problem, just put the pillow to 2 days. Please give this pillow a little patience, it can give you a generous return. Any other questions welcome to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714vvLh7I3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lomenmon","source_asin":"B0C6DL7X37","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6DL7X37","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6DL7X37","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
