window.products.push({"id":306950,"name":"CLEVAST Air Purifiers for Home Large Room up to 484 sq ft, True HEPA Air Filter with Japanese Motor, 3-Stage Filtration System for 99.97% Smoke, Polle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6134unrmGyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New Strong Wind Road System: We developed a higher wind pressure at the back of the centrifugal fan. We also improved pressurization ducts and the layout of the air grille for more efficient flow pathways. The air can enter in 360 degrees at the bottom of the unit. Maximum wind speed of the air purifier can reach 1680r/min. The powerful air path system allows the air purifier to purify 484 ft²/45m² in 16.5 minutes (CADR: 236CFM). Japanese Nidec Motor: We have imported Japanese Nidec motors to use with our air purifier which are best suitable to those with sleep disorders. High quality motors not only can significantly reduce the noise level to 32dB but also make the CLEVAST purifier more durable and stable. The air purifier uses a high-definition digital screen to display PM2.5 value of the air real-time and has three-color light ring to visually display air quality. ADVANCED 3-STAGE FILTRATION: The powerful filtration system consists of a combination of pre-filter, activated carbon filter, and H13 true HEPA filter. The HEPA air purifier can clean 99.97% of formaldehyde, VOCs, hair, smoke, pet dander, harmful gases and other fine particles up to 0.3 microns in size (Search for B088LLWZQW for a replacement filter.) EASY TO CONTROL: Adjust the fan speed model（Six fan speed modes/Sleep mode/Automatic mode) of the portable air purifier to clean different air quality and depending on personal preference. 12 timer options allow you set the air purifier operating time. The check filter indicator will let you know when it’s time for a fresh filter. New technology-lock sets can avoid error operations efficiently caused by pets or children out of curiosity. LIFETIME WARRANTY: Every CLEVAST product is covered with a lifetime warranty and technical support. Please don't hesitate to contact us if there is an issue with your HEPA air purifiers for home, CLEVAST customer support team is here for you 24/7.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6134unrmGyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CLEVAST","source_asin":"B096Y9WJ4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-306950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096Y9WJ4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096Y9WJ4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
